<title>USA: Alcan keeps September ingot at 75 cents/lb.</title>
<headline>Alcan keeps September ingot at 75 cents/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium said its September ingot list price for the United States was 75 cents per pound, with extrusion billet at 85 cents per pound, both unchanged from August.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
